<section id="s-results" data-code="results">
<div class="section-no">06 — Benchmark Payoff</div>
<h2>Decisive Multimodal Payoffs</h2>
<p>Gemini Embedding 2 establishes new state-of-the-art results across standard unimodal, cross-modal, and multimodal tasks. Most notably, the model achieves a score of 62.9 Recall@1 on MSCOCO, 68.8 NDCG@10 on Vatex, and 84.0 on MTEB Code, outperforming specialized models.</p>
<p>By learning a continuous audio representation natively, Gemini Embedding 2 scores 73.99 MRR@10 on the Massive Sound Embedding Benchmark (MSEB), substantially beating the ASR-cascade baseline (70.40), particularly in cross-lingual retrieval scenarios.</p>

